# Repo integrity

In Sep 2026, `origin/dev` tip `57cf216` was a rewritten fake of `auto import types` with obfuscated malware in `tailwind.config.js` and a fake font `fa-solid-400.woff2`, plus `.gitignore` changes that un-ignored `.env` / `.vscode`.

## Agent rules

- Prefer local history over unexpected remote rewrites with the same commit message but different tree/hash.
- Never `git pull` / merge / checkout a diverged remote tip without comparing trees first (`git diff -w HEAD origin/<branch>`, inspect `tailwind.config.js`).
- Reject configs that append obfuscated `_0x…` / `global['!']` payloads, or “font” files that are JS.
- Keep `.env`, `.env.local`, and secrets gitignored. Do not weaken `.gitignore` for those paths.
- To restore a known-good local branch onto GitHub: `git push --force-with-lease origin <branch>` only after confirming local tip is clean.
